title: Nationalities
card-image: img/cards/nationalities.svg?v=2
subtitle: The Ukrainian Rada, Finland and Transcaucasia.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: coalition_affairs
view-if: nationalities_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; nationalities_timer = 4

The empire's peoples want autonomy or independence: the Ukrainian Central Rada, the Finnish Diet, the Georgians, who vote Menshevik, the Baltic peoples, the Muslims of the Volga and Central Asia.

- @rada: Recognise the Ukrainian Rada's autonomy.
- @finland: Let the Finnish Diet govern its own affairs.
- @caucasus: Support a federal Transcaucasia led by the Georgian Mensheviks.
- @unity: Insist on the unity of the Russian state until the Assembly meets.
- @easy_discard

@rada

How should the party go about it? Cautiously, with compromises, it will cost a resource, do less and anger less. In full, it will do all that it says, and its opponents will answer. And a party strong enough can carry it out and break its opponents.

- @rada_slow: Go about it cautiously, with compromises.
- @rada_decree: Carry it out in full.
- @rada_force: Carry it out in full, and break any opposition by force.

@rada_slow
choose-if: resources >= 1
subtitle: Milder effects and little anger. Costs 1 resource.
unavailable-subtitle: We have nothing to pay the compensation with.
on-arrival: {!

RO.law(Q, 'slow', () => {
RO.boost(Q, {nations: 4});
RO.add(Q, {rel_kad: -4, right_threat: 2, rel_ally: 1});
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 0, 3);
}, "Recognise the Ukrainian Rada's autonomy");
!}

The Rada is recognised as the government of Ukraine's autonomy. [? if gov_kadets = 1 : Three Kadet ministers have resigned over it. ?][? if gov_kadets = 0 : The Kadets, outside the cabinet, call it the end of Russia. ?] (It was done cautiously, with compromises.)



