The Rada is recognised as the government of Ukraine's autonomy. [? if gov_kadets = 1 : Three Kadet ministers have resigned over it. ?][? if gov_kadets = 0 : The Kadets, outside the cabinet, call it the end of Russia. ?] [+ law_text +]

@finland

How should the party go about it? Cautiously, with compromises, it will cost a resource, do less and anger less. In full, it will do all that it says, and its opponents will answer. And a party strong enough can carry it out and break its opponents.

- @finland_slow: Go about it cautiously, with compromises.
- @finland_decree: Carry it out in full.
- @finland_force: Carry it out in full, and break any opposition by force.

@finland_slow
choose-if: resources >= 1
subtitle: Milder effects and little anger. Costs 1 resource.
unavailable-subtitle: We have nothing to pay the compensation with.
on-arrival: {!

RO.law(Q, 'slow', () => {
RO.boost(Q, {nations: 2});
RO.add(Q, {rel_kad: -2, right_threat: 1});
}, "Let the Finnish Diet govern its own affairs");
!}

The Finns are to govern their internal affairs. The question of independence is left for the Assembly. (It was done cautiously, with compromises.)



